Let \vec a, \vec b, \vec c and \vec y be the three
dimensional vectors
\vec a = 4\,\mathit{\vec j}+4\,\mathit{\vec k},\quad \vec b = -5\,\mathit{\vec i}+4\,\mathit{\vec j}+3\,\mathit{\vec k},\quad \vec c = 2\,\mathit{\vec i}+6\,\mathit{\vec j},\quad \vec y = 7\,\mathit{\vec i}-6\,\mathit{\vec j}
